00:21:11.120 --> 00:21:13.240
you're breaking all these high school records,

483
00:21:13.240 --> 00:21:17.050
it's absolutely insane winning high school titles.

484
00:21:17.050 --> 00:21:20.403
And you essentially go pro right out of high school,

