00:21:21.630 --> 00:21:24.380
and start working with Alberto Salazar.

486
00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:28.513
You move to Portland when you're 17, 16?

487
00:21:29.870 --> 00:21:31.570
And that's where things start to get

488
00:21:31.570 --> 00:21:33.304
a little bit janky, right?

489
00:21:33.304 --> 00:21:35.460
So talk a little bit about

