00:22:25.220 --> 00:22:27.550
I traveled out and was kind of like with their team

509
00:22:27.550 --> 00:22:30.010
for maybe three or four weeks or something,

510
00:22:30.010 --> 00:22:32.623
but it was always these kind of like little moments,

511
00:22:33.650 --> 00:22:35.240
and it was always so much fun, right?

512
00:22:35.240 --> 00:22:38.120
Because you have your coach

513
00:22:38.120 --> 00:22:40.570
on the ground with me in New York, John Henwood,

514
00:22:40.570 --> 00:22:42.290
who was kind of that buffer.

