01:23:05.460 --> 01:23:07.143
So I spent a year in New York during which-

1823
01:23:07.143 --> 01:23:09.490
So that was always the plan to go back.

1824
01:23:09.490 --> 01:23:11.950
And let's just pause for a moment.

1825
01:23:11.950 --> 01:23:14.960
I mean, I'm so sorry that that happened to you and,

