1865
01:25:06.620 --> 01:25:08.480
This is super unprofessional. I'm really sorry.

1866
01:25:08.480 --> 01:25:11.260
I'm sorry, I'm disrupting the workout.

1867
01:25:11.260 --> 01:25:12.494
