1873
01:25:33.660 --> 01:25:36.120
something wasn't done for them,

1874
01:25:36.120 --> 01:25:39.470
but rather than kind of recognize it as wrong

1875
01:25:39.470 --> 01:25:42.490
in that moment and it maybe even right now,

1876
01:25:42.490 --> 01:25:46.423
they were still saying, sorry, don't say, sorry.

1877
01:25:47.370 --> 01:25:48.520
In those moments,

1878
01:25:48.520 --> 01:25:51.270
the right thing to do would have been get me help.

1879
01:25:51.270 --> 01:25:52.660
In those moments the right thing

1880
01:25:52.660 --> 01:25:54.340
that anybody should have done

1881
01:25:54.340 --> 01:25:57.260
