that it's about sexual abuse or doping only,

1908
01:27:00.150 --> 01:27:01.663
and that's kind of the limits.

1909
01:27:02.650 --> 01:27:05.090
I think people need to better understand that

1910
01:27:05.990 --> 01:27:07.290
it does expand to

1911
01:27:07.290 --> 01:27:08.514
all of these kinds of mental health situations.

1912
