it's all about really like a coach's guidebook to abuse,

1914
01:27:14.854 --> 01:27:16.940
and what not to do.

1915
01:27:16.940 --> 01:27:18.660
And I think they really

1916
01:27:18.660 --> 01:27:20.690
incredible thing about their programming

1917
01:27:20.690 --> 01:27:22.800
is the fact that it's real,

1918
01:27:22.800 --> 01:27:25.020
I mean, it's really well done,

1919
