1926
01:27:41.680 --> 01:27:43.990
And the reason is there are so many different things

1927
01:27:43.990 --> 01:27:46.517
that I even look back on my experience and I'm like,

1928
01:27:46.517 --> 01:27:50.527
"God, that was part of the toxicity."

1929
01:27:51.580 --> 01:27:54.573
If you're working with a 16 or 17 year old,

1930
