"This person is like my uncle. I can't let them down."

1941
01:28:40.510 --> 01:28:41.660
Yeah, well, it's more than that.

1942
01:28:41.660 --> 01:28:45.290
This is the person who's going to help me realize my dream.

1943
01:28:45.290 --> 01:28:47.200
And this is the person who believes in me,

1944
01:28:47.200 --> 01:28:49.660
