1945
01:28:49.660 --> 01:28:51.680
It's unbelievably intoxicating.

1946
01:28:51.680 --> 01:28:52.513
Yes.

1947
01:28:52.513 --> 01:28:55.340
But what the point that I'm trying to make is

1948
01:28:55.340 --> 01:28:59.570
I understand well how potent and powerful that dynamic is.

1949
01:28:59.570 --> 01:29:02.600
And when you're a young person and you're impressionable,

1950
01:29:02.600 --> 01:29:03.433
you don't want your parents,

1951
01:29:03.433 --> 01:29:05.900
your parents, what they have to say is irrelevant.

1952
01:29:05.900 --> 01:29:07.067
You're protecting this very,

1953
01:29:07.067 --> 01:29:09.200
you feel very special.

1954
01:29:09.200 --> 01:29:12.050
You are the person who is touched,

1955
01:29:12.050 --> 01:29:13.630
