and doing the, getting drug tested?

2056
01:33:45.791 --> 01:33:48.250
Yeah, I was drug tested a ton.

2057
01:33:48.250 --> 01:33:51.240
And I always joke,

2058
01:33:51.240 --> 01:33:54.023
I was in that big Fancy Bear's leak,

2059
01:33:55.230 --> 01:33:57.460
my information was threatened to be leaked,

2060
01:33:57.460 --> 01:33:59.980
but on it it said two Flintstone Vitamins,

2061
01:33:59.980 --> 01:34:03.460
and two iron tablets, and vitamin D,

2062
01:34:03.460 --> 01:34:05.317
and so, they never released it.

2063
01:34:05.317 --> 01:34:08.740
And I felt so both vindicated,

2064
01:34:08.740 --> 01:34:12.640
but also kind of put out that I'm on food still vitamins,

2065
01:34:12.640 --> 01:34:16.353
like, "Watch them cower," as I walk out to the track.

2066
01:34:17.330 --> 01:34:21.120
But the thing is I was always saying no,

2067
01:34:21.120 --> 01:34:23.987
and it was always coming back to weight of like,

2068
01:34:23.987 --> 01:34:24.910
"Well, you need this

2069
01:34:24.910 --> 01:34:27.200
because thyroid can make you skinnier too,

2070
01:34:27.200 --> 01:34:30.110
and birth control for weight loss."

2071
01:34:30.110 --> 01:34:34.823
And I think that's just important to say

2072
01:34:36.820 --> 01:34:40.060
because sometimes it also just makes me be

2073
01:34:40.060 --> 01:34:43.967
when the other athletes were like, "Just buy in already,"

2074
01:34:45.520 --> 01:34:47.960
was that something else?

2075
01:34:47.960 --> 01:34:50.340
And the answer is, I don't know.

2076
01:34:50.340 --> 01:34:53.670
And sometimes I wish I could go back

2077
01:34:53.670 --> 01:34:57.720
and have been more conscious in those moments

2078
01:34:57.720 --> 01:35:00.967
of what was really going on but-

2079
01:35:00.967 --> 01:35:03.300
Was there pressure from the other athletes

2080
01:35:03.300 --> 01:35:05.803
to get on board with some kind of protocol?

2081
01:35:06.840 --> 01:35:09.730
Well, we did have a team bonding trip and during it,

2082
01:35:09.730 --> 01:35:11.630
one of the athletes did tell me that

2083
01:35:11.630 --> 01:35:15.390
I needed to step up and stop being such a baby.

2084
01:35:15.390 --> 01:35:20.390
And kind of either you got to buy in

2085
01:35:20.420 --> 01:35:22.743
or you're not on the team sort of talk.

2086
01:35:24.229 --> 01:35:28.710
And it was funny 'cause it was this team bonding trip.

2087
01:35:28.710 --> 01:35:31.390
And I was the first person to talk,

2088
01:35:31.390 --> 01:35:33.010
and I was like, "This was so much fun,

2089
01:35:33.010 --> 01:35:35.990
we made memories and friendship, and I'm 12."

2090
01:35:35.990 --> 01:35:38.223
And then the next person to go was like,

2091
01:35:39.717 --> 01:35:40.993
"You have to step it up.

2092
01:35:42.880 --> 01:35:44.260
You either have to be professional,

2093
01:35:44.260 --> 01:35:45.980
or off this team" kind of talk,

2094
01:35:45.980 --> 01:35:48.547
and I was like, "Well, the friendships are over."

2095
01:35:50.500 --> 01:35:54.730
So I think it's just,

2096
01:35:54.730 --> 01:35:59.730
I'm only saying this because I think in so many ways,

2097
01:36:00.840 --> 01:36:05.560
the reason that this system of current sponsorship

2098
01:36:05.560 --> 01:36:10.560
is troubling is because all lines become blurred.

2099
01:36:11.470 --> 01:36:14.810
Because if everything is about performance, right?

2100
01:36:14.810 --> 01:36:17.400
Well, things like weight is gonna be overstepped.

2101
01:36:17.400 --> 01:36:20.270
But how much of the weight overstepping was because

2102
01:36:20.270 --> 01:36:24.110
there was maybe a want for cheating the habit?

2103
01:36:24.110 --> 01:36:25.223
I don't know.

2104
01:36:26.450 --> 01:36:30.730
And so, when everything is about performance,

2105
01:36:30.730 --> 01:36:35.460
then kind of however you get there,

2106
01:36:35.460 --> 01:36:37.120
people act like it's okay.

2107
01:36:37.120 --> 01:36:39.240
And if it means burning some people out,

2108
01:36:39.240 --> 01:36:40.780
if it means stepping all over people,

2109
01:36:40.780 --> 01:36:43.603
if it means treating people poorly,

2110
01:36:45.410 --> 01:36:47.360
it's not personal, it's business

2111
01:36:47.360 --> 01:36:50.370
was always the catch phrase that I used to hear.

2112
01:36:50.370 --> 01:36:55.370
And I'm like businesses that operate like this aren't good.

2113
01:36:57.690 --> 01:37:00.910
And usually ultimately that comes to light,

2114
01:37:00.910 --> 01:37:02.560
and there has to be a reckoning.

2115
01:37:02.560 --> 01:37:06.260
And I think society should never condone

2116
01:37:06.260 --> 01:37:09.730
that sort of behavior for the sake of performance

2117
01:37:09.730 --> 01:37:11.800
because there are plenty of people who are performing

2118
01:37:11.800 --> 01:37:13.450
incredibly and who don't do that.

2119
01:37:14.800 --> 01:37:16.682
Well, this did all come out.

2120
01:37:16.682 --> 01:37:20.950
I mean, all of this was going on for you in 2015, right?

2121
01:37:20.950 --> 01:37:25.420
Yeah, so 2015, 2016, I was still on the team.

2122
01:37:25.420 --> 01:37:27.820
What ultimately happened was that again,

2123
01:37:27.820 --> 01:37:29.830
I had kind of wanted just,

2124
01:37:29.830 --> 01:37:30.820
I stayed on the team,

2125
01:37:30.820 --> 01:37:32.040
and I wanted to ultimately

2126
01:37:32.040 --> 01:37:33.993
be back on the team in this full way.

2127
01:37:35.050 --> 01:37:36.750
But as I had mentioned earlier,

2128
01:37:36.750 --> 01:37:39.360
I had never told my parents about the cutting.

2129
01:37:39.360 --> 01:37:42.220
They only knew that I was struggling with food.

2130
01:37:42.220 --> 01:37:45.060
And after the Olympic trials,

2131
01:37:45.060 --> 01:37:50.060
my current coach, John Henwood, caught me cutting myself.

2132
01:37:53.870 --> 01:37:57.453
He immediately called my parents, and was like,

2133
01:37:57.453 --> 01:37:59.150
"I'm really sorry.

2134
01:37:59.150 --> 01:38:03.483
She asked me not to call you, but I'm really scared for her.

2135
01:38:04.760 --> 01:38:06.943
And I don't know what to do.

2136
01:38:06.943 --> 01:38:10.180
I don't know what I'm supposed to do in this situation,

2137
01:38:10.180 --> 01:38:11.313
but I'm here with her.

2138
01:38:13.860 --> 01:38:14.807
I need help."

2139
01:38:16.515 --> 01:38:17.777
He did what you're supposed to do.

2140
01:38:17.777 --> 01:38:19.980
He did what a grownup would do.

2141
01:38:19.980 --> 01:38:21.256
And I was so mad at him.
And he admitted

2142
01:38:21.256 --> 01:38:22.447
that he didn't know.

2143
01:38:22.447 --> 01:38:25.097
And he admitted that he didn't know how to handle it.

2144
01:38:26.270 --> 01:38:30.200
And I was so mad at him for years afterwards.

2145
01:38:30.200 --> 01:38:32.150
And I have always loved John.

2146
01:38:32.150 --> 01:38:32.983
It wasn't like that,

2147
01:38:32.983 --> 01:38:37.960
but to me it was like this horrible moment because one,

2148
01:38:39.710 --> 01:38:40.820
I was super embarrassed,

2149
01:38:40.820 --> 01:38:43.550
and now my parents know, and that's embarrassing.

2150
01:38:43.550 --> 01:38:48.550
And two, my parents were like, "You have to leave this team.

2151
01:38:48.790 --> 01:38:49.865
This is destroying you.

2152
01:38:49.865 --> 01:38:53.390
This is tearing you apart. You have to leave."

2153
01:38:53.390 --> 01:38:56.300
And I think there was a period of time

2154
01:38:56.300 --> 01:38:59.450
where my parents could not understand

2155
01:38:59.450 --> 01:39:04.450
why I so couldn't see that the system was a problem.

2156
01:39:08.490 --> 01:39:09.660
And I think part of it was

2157
01:39:09.660 --> 01:39:11.260
they didn't know a lot of these stories,

2158
01:39:11.260 --> 01:39:13.010
these stories that I'm telling now.

2159
01:39:14.100 --> 01:39:15.490
I sat my parents down

2160
01:39:15.490 --> 01:39:16.860
before "The New York Times" piece came out,

2161
01:39:16.860 --> 01:39:18.140
and I just told them everything.

2162
01:39:18.140 --> 01:39:21.360
And so, there's so many more moments that

2163
01:39:21.360 --> 01:39:24.200
I've never talked about, and aren't even public

2164
01:39:25.320 --> 01:39:30.070
that they almost saw what was happening to me,

2165
01:39:30.070 --> 01:39:32.420
but they didn't even know how it was happening.

2166
01:39:33.530 --> 01:39:37.840
But, they told me like, "This is a bad set up for you.

2167
01:39:37.840 --> 01:39:41.000
You have to have health being your number one."

2168
01:39:41.000 --> 01:39:46.000
And so, I left the team and then the sad irony is that

2169
01:39:48.270 --> 01:39:49.657
that's when my body was finally like,

2170
01:39:49.657 --> 01:39:52.280
"You've been doing damage for so many years."

2171
01:39:52.280 --> 01:39:55.020
My bone density was lowered substantially,

2172
01:39:55.020 --> 01:39:56.823
and then I started to break.

2173
01:39:57.870 --> 01:40:00.593
And it was this kind of tragic,

2174
01:40:02.190 --> 01:40:03.940
yes, I had the left,

2175
01:40:03.940 --> 01:40:06.700
but I think because I didn't actually let go,

2176
01:40:06.700 --> 01:40:08.880
and I didn't actually understand

2177
01:40:09.920 --> 01:40:13.500
what was wrong with the situation

2178
01:40:13.500 --> 01:40:16.483
that it just I was in this cycle.

2179
01:40:17.500 --> 01:40:20.300
And the truth is what snapped me out of it was

2180
01:40:20.300 --> 01:40:23.943
when the USADA report came out in which Alberto was banned,

2181
01:40:25.740 --> 01:40:28.607
my first, my immediate reaction was like,

2182
01:40:28.607 --> 01:40:31.799
"No way, he didn't do anything,"

2183
01:40:31.799 --> 01:40:34.130
that was literally my first reaction to it.

2184
01:40:34.130 --> 01:40:37.770
And I the next day read the whole entire report,

2185
01:40:37.770 --> 01:40:40.040
it's 270 pages.

2186
01:40:40.040 --> 01:40:41.313
I read it word for word.

2187
01:40:42.530 --> 01:40:45.930
And holy crap,

2188
01:40:45.930 --> 01:40:50.130
it was the first time I saw on paper that they lied.

2189
01:40:50.130 --> 01:40:52.520
And there's so many moments in it where

2190
01:40:52.520 --> 01:40:54.427
it'll say something like,

2191
01:40:54.427 --> 01:40:57.970
"Athletes on the team were told that

2192
01:40:59.750 --> 01:41:04.100
USADA I had given them permission to do blank," right?

2193
01:41:04.100 --> 01:41:06.400
And I had been told that, I thought that was true,

2194
01:41:06.400 --> 01:41:08.210
of course, yes.

2195
01:41:08.210 --> 01:41:11.337
This giant company that's telling me that,

2196
01:41:11.337 --> 01:41:13.510
"We got full approvals, don't worry about it,

2197
01:41:13.510 --> 01:41:15.290
all these allegations are lies."

2198
01:41:15.290 --> 01:41:17.297
You're kind of like,

2199
01:41:17.297 --> 01:41:19.430
"I don't know, they're worth billions of dollars,

2200
01:41:19.430 --> 01:41:22.460
I think they're telling the truth."

2201
01:41:22.460 --> 01:41:25.743
What's your sense of how high up that went at Nike?

2202
01:41:27.480 --> 01:41:28.313
Very.

2203
01:41:31.160 --> 01:41:34.200
The CEO stepped down. That high?

2204
01:41:34.200 --> 01:41:36.890
I mean, he was in on the emails.

2205
01:41:36.890 --> 01:41:37.870
And again, some of this stuff happened

2206
01:41:37.870 --> 01:41:41.377
before I was on the team, actually almost all of it did.

2207
01:41:41.377 --> 01:41:43.620
Yeah, and all these people have come out

2208
01:41:43.620 --> 01:41:45.870
going back to 2008, right?

2209
01:41:45.870 --> 01:41:47.320
Telling stories about this.

2210
01:41:47.320 --> 01:41:48.153
Yeah.

2211
01:41:48.153 --> 01:41:51.150
And so, I was always,

2212
01:41:51.150 --> 01:41:52.030
there was no,

2213
01:41:52.030 --> 01:41:54.510
I almost was never there firsthand.

2214
01:41:54.510 --> 01:41:57.140
I was only ever hearing things second hand

2215
01:41:57.140 --> 01:41:58.840
because I joined the team in 20,

2216
01:41:58.840 --> 01:42:01.400
well, I started working with Alberto in 2012.

2217
01:42:01.400 --> 01:42:03.610
Seriously actually joined the team in 2013,

2218
01:42:03.610 --> 01:42:05.530
and it was around then

2219
01:42:05.530 --> 01:42:07.490
that allegation started to pop up, right?

2220
01:42:07.490 --> 01:42:10.210
So I'm already in the bubble, I'm already in the system.

2221
01:42:10.210 --> 01:42:14.113
And when you're being told like, "No, that was misconstrued.

2222
01:42:15.100 --> 01:42:19.300
All 10 of us are saying, this was actually what happened,

2223
01:42:19.300 --> 01:42:23.090
you weren't there but here's some story,"

2224
01:42:23.090 --> 01:42:24.440
you're kind of like, "I trust these people.

2225
01:42:24.440 --> 01:42:25.413
They're my friends.

2226
01:42:26.620 --> 01:42:28.247
They wouldn't do me wrong."

2227
01:42:29.360 --> 01:42:32.980
And so, as I was reading the USADA report,

2228
01:42:32.980 --> 01:42:35.907
there were all of these moments of me being like,

2229
01:42:35.907 --> 01:42:38.840
"Oh my God, USADA is telling me that I was lied to.

2230
01:42:38.840 --> 01:42:39.890
And I'm one of the athletes

2231
01:42:39.890 --> 01:42:41.820
that they're sub-tweeting this thing

2232
01:42:41.820 --> 01:42:44.020
of saying that they thought this was the thing,"

2233
01:42:44.020 --> 01:42:47.337
and I was just frozen.

2234
01:42:49.790 --> 01:42:51.990
And even now trying to describe the feeling

2235
01:42:51.990 --> 01:42:56.990
it's like I had just so many emotions run through me

2236
01:42:57.560 --> 01:43:02.250
because that was when the flood opened for me internally,

2237
01:43:02.250 --> 01:43:03.793
and I suddenly was like,

2238
01:43:04.937 --> 01:43:09.350
"Whoa, if everything in this was a lie,

2239
01:43:09.350 --> 01:43:11.970
then what else was happening

2240
01:43:11.970 --> 01:43:15.270
that I've never let myself come to terms with?"

2241
01:43:15.270 --> 01:43:18.010
And the thing is had you talked to me

2242
01:43:18.010 --> 01:43:20.590
the day before the USADA report came out,

2243
01:43:20.590 --> 01:43:22.027
and you looked me in the eye and you said,

2244
01:43:22.027 --> 01:43:23.550
"I know everything you went through,

2245
01:43:23.550 --> 01:43:25.660
you were emotionally abused,"

2246
01:43:25.660 --> 01:43:26.690
put a laugh at your face,

2247
01:43:26.690 --> 01:43:27.730
I would've walked away I mean like,

2248
01:43:27.730 --> 01:43:31.070
What is that guy talking about?"

2249
01:43:31.070 --> 01:43:34.143
But as soon as I knew,

2250
01:43:36.640 --> 01:43:41.640
I could look back on my experience and I could see the lies,

2251
01:43:42.150 --> 01:43:45.363
and I could see the abuse for what it was,

2252
01:43:46.600 --> 01:43:51.540
that was the most, both empowering and terrifying moment.

2253
01:43:51.540 --> 01:43:53.360
Right, it shatters the illusion.

2254
01:43:53.360 --> 01:43:54.850
Complete shattering.

2255
01:43:54.850 --> 01:43:59.850
And, again, I think really the scary thing about abuse

2256
01:44:01.200 --> 01:44:05.860
is that the reason it takes years for people to come out

2257
01:44:05.860 --> 01:44:10.860
is because so often they don't even know that's what it was.

2258
01:44:11.590 --> 01:44:14.840
And for me, it was like as soon as I knew

2259
01:44:15.840 --> 01:44:17.563
that was what had happened,

2260
01:44:18.850 --> 01:44:19.807
my first thought was,

2261
01:44:19.807 --> 01:44:22.670
"Holy crap. There's other people who don't know."

2262
01:44:22.670 --> 01:44:23.503
And that's scary.

2263
01:44:23.503 --> 01:44:27.300
It also explains why you wanted back on the team, right?

2264
01:44:27.300 --> 01:44:29.970
Which is part and parcel of Nike's big defense

2265
01:44:29.970 --> 01:44:30.827
in all of this like,

2266
01:44:30.827 --> 01:44:32.270
"What do you mean she's saying all this stuff?

2267
01:44:32.270 --> 01:44:33.780
She was trying to get back on the team.

2268
01:44:33.780 --> 01:44:35.797
I'm like, "Yeah, of course."
We didn't know about any,

2269
01:44:35.797 --> 01:44:36.630
so, right.

2270
01:44:38.360 --> 01:44:42.390
So, well, Salazor gets banned in September of 2019, right?

2271
01:44:42.390 --> 01:44:44.247
So does that report come out in advance of that,

2272
01:44:44.247 --> 01:44:45.551
or did those things, they came out at the same time.

2273
01:44:45.551 --> 01:44:47.710
It was like they happened same moment,

2274
01:44:47.710 --> 01:44:49.217
and then six weeks later,

2275
01:44:49.217 --> 01:44:50.340
"The New York Times" piece came out.

2276
01:44:50.340 --> 01:44:52.270
They were the longest six weeks in my life.

2277
01:44:52.270 --> 01:44:56.310
So, there's a good three year period

2278
01:44:57.300 --> 01:45:02.300
where you go from being Mary Cain, fastest girl in America,

2279
01:45:03.030 --> 01:45:05.010
bright future,

2280
01:45:05.010 --> 01:45:07.820
Olympic glory is a foregone conclusion for this person.

2281
01:45:07.820 --> 01:45:09.770
There was even a "New York Times" article about you

2282
01:45:09.770 --> 01:45:11.100
in 2015, right?

2283
01:45:11.100 --> 01:45:12.370
And painted this-
Which was a whole thing.

2284
01:45:12.370 --> 01:45:13.610
Glorious picture,

2285
01:45:13.610 --> 01:45:15.970
you're whitewashing this whole experience.

2286
01:45:15.970 --> 01:45:19.380
But then there's this period where you disappear, right?

2287
01:45:19.380 --> 01:45:21.490
It's like, "What happened to Mary Cain?

2288
01:45:21.490 --> 01:45:23.180
She just vanished off the landscape."

2289
01:45:23.180 --> 01:45:26.860
You go home, you're trying to piece yourself back together

2290
01:45:26.860 --> 01:45:27.950
during this period of time.

2291
01:45:27.950 --> 01:45:30.200
It's this fallow era where

2292
01:45:30.200 --> 01:45:34.970
suddenly you're nowhere to be found, then...

2293
01:45:34.970 --> 01:45:37.110
So you're dealing with what you're dealing with

2294
01:45:37.110 --> 01:45:39.550
and trying to come to terms with this,

2295
01:45:39.550 --> 01:45:42.040
but still buying into all of it,

2296
01:45:42.040 --> 01:45:43.870
thinking you're gonna make your way back, right?

2297
01:45:43.870 --> 01:45:45.550
Until this report comes out.

2298
01:45:45.550 --> 01:45:47.330
And I'll say this, right?

2299
01:45:47.330 --> 01:45:52.330
So I was like, "I'm not tough enough. I can't handle it.

2300
01:45:53.150 --> 01:45:56.460
I'm maybe not built to be a pro," right?

2301
01:45:56.460 --> 01:46:00.747
And what ended up happening was I kind of had this injury,

2302
01:46:04.070 --> 01:46:09.070
and again, my parents, my coach, John, nobody,

2303
01:46:09.550 --> 01:46:12.203
I hadn't really shared a lot of these stories with.

2304
01:46:13.340 --> 01:46:16.610
There was maybe inklings of it and pieces of it,

2305
01:46:16.610 --> 01:46:18.993
but with everything you're just,

2306
01:46:19.990 --> 01:46:21.880
if I can't even look back on that,

2307
01:46:21.880 --> 01:46:23.880
how could I share that with somebody else?

