01:52:27.083 --> 01:52:30.230
But that's pretty fast from a crack in the glasses

2427
01:52:30.230 --> 01:52:34.270
to like, "I feel the need to talk about this now."

2428
01:52:34.270 --> 01:52:36.650
Yes, and I think it's because

2429
