they're such a frantic energy,

2430
01:52:38.450 --> 01:52:43.450
and this almost fear that happens in that moment.

2431
01:52:43.740 --> 01:52:46.970
Because I'm gonna say that

2432
01:52:46.970 --> 01:52:49.653
this whole situation has made me,

2433
01:52:50.840 --> 01:52:51.755
and this is bad,

2434
